# ---- the hub runs no agent build work (BH-393, hub only) ----
# bin/lib/hub-box.sh is asked by bin/agent-call.sh (rc 77, nothing called and
# nothing billed), bin/run-build.sh (BUILD_REFUSED hub-no-build, rc 3),
# bin/run-preplan.sh (rc 3, no plan dir) and bin/up10-lane.sh. One deduped
# ALERTS line per (lane, ticket) per UTC day. See docs/HUB-THINNING-PLAN.md.
# HUB_BUILD_OK=1 lets THIS box build even though it is the hub. It does not
# cover up10-lane.sh --here, which has no override.
#HUB_BUILD_OK=1
# The refused list. `review` is absent on purpose: the hub's review lanes have
# not moved yet, and refusing it would stop every PR review in the fleet.
#HUB_NO_BUILD_LANES=build plan preplan preplan-files execute fix qa
# The hub's FLEET name (bin/box-name.sh), never its hostname.
#HUB_BOX_NAME=box-hub

